OL,3,GNEWSAHow the European question impacts
OL,4,Aon Scotland's future
OL,5,
OL,6,FRachel Reeves must have been smarting
OL,7,Fthis week as the new Chancellor stood
OL,8,Fon the steps of No 11 Downing Street -
OL,9,Fbut she's now using her former platform
OL,10,Fto make a clarion call for Britain's
OL,11,Fre-entry into the European Union.
OL,13,FHer former rank carries weight and adds
OL,14,Ffuel to the prime minister's arguments
OL,15,Fon re-opening the EU debate.
OL,17,FThat also opens up a Pandora's box of
OL,18,Finter-twining constitutional questions
OL,19,Fhere in Scotland.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,428,420,260,160,0,100
